# Resources embedded in the offline lobby (offline/tools/gen_resources.py -> dw_embedded.cpp).
# Names are those of the Python lobby's resources/ folder. `name = path` takes the bytes elsewhere.
#
# Deliberately NOT embedded (the product differs from the Python lobby's test tree here):
#   wallet.json            holds balances keyed by real player ids
#   purchased_items.txt    19 legacy purchases the Python lobby seeds into every new account
#   map_spawns.proposed.json and the repository-root weapon tables: only the retired Python match
#                          server read them
#   broadcast.info, ffotd_client.ff: not in the Python repository; without them the ticker is empty
#                          and the client skips the FFOTD (BD_NO_FILE), as against a fresh Python lobby

# publisher files the client fetches at login (service 10 task 7)
mp_playlists_shipRetail_cb2.info
configs_s.info
questionnaire.info
activities.info
mp_rewardlists.info
# per-player files and their new-account seeds (service 10 task 3)
blacklist
mpdata.level1.proposed
mpdata_s.level1.proposed
mpdata_s.unlockall.proposed
# structured data definitions of mpdata / mpdata_s
playerdata_defs.proposed.json
# rank table, challenges, weapon levels
unlock_tables.proposed.json
progression_tables.json
# store
marketplace_catalogue.json
unlock_flags.json
items_cha.txt
items_cha_default.proposed
items_cha_unlockall.proposed
